# md with +10d on an Upcoming entry moves its due date past the week and it leaves the view; the next entry takes the focus.
file <<END
- Report @due({today+2})
- Mail @due({today+3})
END
keys gU
see ▌ - Report
keys md
see Due date
type +10d
keys <Enter>
hide Report
see ▌ - Mail
quit
saved <<END
- Report @due({today+10})
- Mail @due({today+3})
END
